==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Car (Enemy Base)|Car]].

==Strategy==
While it is impossible to lose in this stage, to get the highest score you'll need to destroy it quickly with fast units like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] or [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)| Cow Cat]] and high DPS units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]].

